THE GATES, asserted by the launcher before any spend, per arm. A failure is ARM NOT READ for that arm.
  G1  the arm's worktree is at the registered commit, clean, and its src tree hash is the registered one.
  G2  the world is provisioned and unrun: initialised, agent state IDLE, 0 session files, no serve.log, starting queue
