      kit files identical to the control's, no leaked mount.
  G3  INSIDE the sandbox, under the run's own environment: zakcode imports from the arm's tree; the arm's marker is
      right (T's loop class has ADR-0205's method and C's does not; both have ADR-0204's rails; the rails_silenced
      field is in T's source only); the five luna categories send reasoning_effort none WITH tools and no field
      without, and classify sends none either way (W1a-C, as corrected on 2026-09-19); the idle-window stop is unset.
